not checked by plan — apply still runs these, and they need a live warehouse
  - warehouse connection probes — apply builds every declared connection and reads through it before it lands, and a dead credential aborts the apply
  - eval-case expected_sql EXECUTED against the warehouse (plan parses it only) — an oracle that parses but errors aborts the apply
